{"id":430,"name":"honchkrow","speciesId":430,"dex":430,"form":"normal","generation":4,"types":["dark","flying"],"stats":{"hp":100,"attack":125,"defense":52,"special-attack":105,"special-defense":52,"speed":71},"abilities":[{"name":"insomnia","hidden":false},{"name":"super-luck","hidden":false},{"name":"moxie","hidden":true}],"height":9,"weight":273,"baseExp":177,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/430.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/430.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/430.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/430.ogg","genus":"Big Boss Pokémon","genusPt":"Pokémon Grande Chefe","flavor":[{"version":"diamond","text":"Becoming active at night, it is known to swarm with numerous MURKROW in tow."},{"version":"pearl","text":"It makes its MURKROW cronies bring it food. It idles its time away, grooming itself in its nest."},{"version":"platinum","text":"If one utters a deep cry, many MURKROW gather quickly. For this, it is called “Summoner of Night.”"},{"version":"heartgold","text":"It is merciless by nature. It is said that it never forgives the mistakes of its MURKROW followers."},{"version":"black","text":"If one utters a deep cry, many Murkrow gather quickly. For this, it is called “Summoner of Night.”"},{"version":"y","text":"Becoming active at night, it is known to swarm with numerous Murkrow in tow."},{"version":"sun","text":"A single cry from this nocturnal Pokémon, and more than a hundred of its Murkrow cronies will assemble."},{"version":"moon","text":"If its Murkrow cronies fail to catch food for it, or if it feels they have betrayed it, it will hunt them down wherever they are and punish them."},{"version":"ultra-sun","text":"It will absolutely not forgive failure from or betrayal by its goons. It has no choice in this if it wants to maintain the order of the flock."},{"version":"ultra-moon","text":"Its goons take care of most of the fighting for it. The only time it dirties its own hands is in delivering a final blow to finish off an opponent."},{"version":"legends-arceus","text":"One cry from this Pokémon, and a murder of Murkrow come flying. At such times, one would think the curtain of night had fallen, plunging the world into jet-black darkness."}],"flavorPt":"Um grito deste Pokémon e o assassinato de Murkrow vem voando. Nessas ocasiões, alguém poderia pensar que a cortina da noite havia caído, mergulhando o mundo em uma escuridão negra.","genderRate":4,"captureRate":30,"eggGroups":["flying"],"isLegendary":false,"isMythical":false,"evolution":{"species":"murkrow","speciesId":198,"evolvesTo":[{"conditions":["Usar Dusk Stone"],"species":"honchkrow","speciesId":430,"evolvesTo":[]}]},"varieties":[{"id":430,"name":"honchkrow","form":"normal","sprite":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/430.png"}],"games":[8,9,10,11,14,15,16,17,18,23,24,25],"moves":[{"id":16,"learn":[[23,"lv",1],[24,"lv",1]]},{"id":17,"learn":[[8,"lv",1],[9,"lv",1],[10,"lv",1],[11,"lv",1],[14,"lv",1],[15,"lv",1],[16,"lv",1],[17,"lv",1],[18,"lv",1],[23,"lv",1],[25,"lv",1]]},{"id":19,"learn":[[8,"tm",0],[9,"tm",0],[10,"tm",0],[11,"tm",0],[14,"tm",0],[15,"tm",0],[16,"tm",0],[17,"tm",0],[18,"tm",0],[23,"tm",0],[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":36,"learn":[[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":38,"learn":[[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":63,"learn":[[8,"tm",0],[9,"tm",0],[10,"tm",0],[11,"tm",0],[14,"tm",0],[15,"tm",0],[16,"tm",0],[17,"tm",0],[18,"tm",0],[23,"tm",0],[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":64,"learn":[[23,"lv",1]]},{"id":86,"learn":[[8,"tm",0],[9,"tm",0],[10,"tm",0],[11,"tm",0],[14,"tm",0],[15,"tm",0],[16,"tm",0],[17,"tm",0],[18,"tm",0],[23,"tm",0],[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":92,"learn":[[8,"tm",0],[9,"tm",0],[10,"tm",0],[11,"tm",0],[14,"tm",0],[15,"tm",0],[16,"tm",0],[17,"tm",0],[18,"tm",0]]},{"